<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Seeking of this age to taste,</l><l>And of it have a part.</l><l>If we only knew, dear Lord,</l><l>The ways we grieve Your heart.</l><l>We would come and turn to You</l><l>With a repenting heart,</l><l>And would give ourselves to be</l><l>With you, O Lord, inside the Ark.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Praise You Lord, we’re safe in You;</l><l>Outside death-waters pour.</l><l>Many things that I once loved</l><l>Are on the ocean floor.</l><l>Keep us open to You Lord,</l><l>Don’t let us miss the mark.</l><l>Hallelujah, praise the Lord,</l><l>We’re here within the church, the Ark.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
